Subject: [PATCH] Preserve the public void GChildWatchFunc dispatch contract

The native dispatcher ignores the existing inner GClosure boolean result.
Keep that inner BOOLEAN/PID GValue protocol while adapting the outer
callback to its exact public type.

--- a/gobject/gsourceclosure.c
+++ b/gobject/gsourceclosure.c
@@ -143,0 +144,10 @@
+/* GChildWatchFunc has a void return. Preserve the existing inner
+ * GClosure BOOLEAN/PID GValue protocol, whose result the source ignores. */
+static void
+g_child_watch_closure_dispatch (GPid     pid,
+                                gint     status,
+                                gpointer data)
+{
+  (void) g_child_watch_closure_callback (pid, status, data);
+}
+
@@ -205 +215 @@
-        closure_callback = (GSourceFunc)g_child_watch_closure_callback;
+        closure_callback = G_SOURCE_FUNC (g_child_watch_closure_dispatch);
